Refresh: tools/version/next.py blink-data (from the Chrome release tools/version/chrome.toml pins; no checkout).

idl/blink.idl: extracted from the Chrome release tools/version/chrome.toml pins third_party/blink/renderer/**/*.idl by
tools/sync/extract_blink_idl.py (dictionaries, enums, typedefs, callbacks, constructors, FrozenArray attributes).
sanitizer/builtins_default_config.json: copied verbatim from the Chrome release tools/version/chrome.toml pins
third_party/blink/renderer/core/sanitizer/builtins_default_config.json (the Sanitizer API's default configuration).
webgpu/wgsl_language_features.json: the WGSL language features the Chrome release tools/version/chrome.toml pins ships
(third_party/dawn/src/tint/lang/wgsl/feature_status.cc), in the order Chrome 150 enumerates them.
idl/blink-returns.json: every regular operation's return type in the Chrome release tools/version/chrome.toml pins's
third_party/blink/renderer/**/*.idl, by tools/sync/extract_blink_idl.py.
idl/blink-frozen-arrays.json: every FrozenArray attribute in the Chrome release tools/version/chrome.toml pins's
third_party/blink/renderer/**/*.idl and what a second read answers (its caching extended attribute, or its
C++ getter's return type in the header beside the IDL file), by tools/sync/extract_blink_idl.py.
